## Supporting Files

- `visualization-base.css` — Mandatory CSS embedded by the generator
- `scripts/intake-server.py` — Local topic form (writes `raw_submission.json`)
- `scripts/wait-for-submission.py` — Blocks until the form is submitted
- `scripts/harvest-sources.py` — Academic API harvest
- `scripts/classify-claims.py` — Claude API stance classification + cache
- `scripts/generate-dossier.py` — HTML dossier builder
- `scripts/mode1-server.py` — HTTP server for Evidence Synthesis APIs

